==Trivia==
*[[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dom Cat]], [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Bondage Cat]], [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu Cat]], [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]], [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]], [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Onmyoji Cat]], [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman Cat]] and [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]] all retain their color schemes from [[Nyanko Defence Force]], which was the first Battle Cats game to show them in full color.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]'s color scheme was first used in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon Collab]].
*[[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]] is the only colored unit in this game who was never previously seen in color.
*For some reason, Dom Cat is renamed to Mistress Cat, while Bondage Cat's name was changed to Bound Cat.
*The Cat Pixies are the only characters in Go! Go! Pogo Cat not to appear in [[The Battle Cats]].

